Tom: I think I''ll try football. I love the feeling of running and passing with a team.
Mia: Football is great. Don''t you get nervous before a big match?
Tom: A little, but the coach always gives us a pep talk to calm us down.
Mia: I''d rather join the wushu group myself.
Tom: Wushu? Why is that?
Mia: I started watching kung fu films as a child, and I''ve admired the athletes ever since.
Tom: That''s a great reason. Let''s both sign up today!', 'Mia 问 Tom 想加入哪项运动;Tom 想踢足球,喜欢和队友奔跑、传球的感觉;赛前会有点紧张,但教练会做赛前动员让大家镇定;Mia 想加入武术组,因为小时候看功夫电影、一直仰慕武术运动员;两人决定当天就报名。', 'uk_female', '[{"q":"Which sport does Tom want to try?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["Football.","Wushu.","Tennis.","Swimming."]},{"q":"Why does Tom like that sport?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["It needs no training.","He loves running and passing with a team.","It is played alone.","It costs no money."]},{"q":"What helps Tom calm down before a big match?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["The coach''s pep talk.","A long sleep.","A cup of tea.","Loud music."]},{"q":"Which group does Mia want to join?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["The football team.","The wushu group.","The running club.","The swimming team."]},{"q":"Why is Mia interested in that sport?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["Her teacher forced her to.","It is the easiest sport.","She has admired the athletes since watching kung fu films.","She wants to avoid football."]}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'long', 'required2', 'U4', 'sufe');
Regular exercise makes the body stronger and helps people sleep better.
Sport also teaches us how to stay calm under pressure.
When we play in a team, we learn to trust and support one another.
Most importantly, sport can turn a hard day into a happy one.', '运动对身心都有益;经常锻炼让身体更强壮、睡得更好;运动还教我们在压力下保持镇静;团队运动让我们学会信任、互相支持;最重要的是,运动能把糟糕的一天变成快乐的一天。', 'uk_female', '[{"q":"What is sport good for?","type":"choice","answer":"D","options":["Only the body.","Only the mind.","Neither of them.","Both the body and the mind."]},{"q":"What does regular exercise help people do?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["Sleep better and grow stronger.","Sleep less.","Feel weaker.","Eat less food."]},{"q":"What does sport teach us about pressure?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["To run away from it.","To stay calm under it.","To shout loudly.","To give up at once."]},{"q":"What do we learn by playing in a team?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["To play alone.","To win at any cost.","To trust and support one another.","To ignore others."]},{"q":"According to the passage, what can sport do to a hard day?","type":"choice","answer":"D","options":["Make it longer.","Make it worse.","Have no effect at all.","Turn it into a happy one."]}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'short', 'required2', 'U4', 'sufe');
Jess: I''m so nervous, Joe. My legs are still shaking.
Coach Joe: Take a few deep breaths. You''ve trained hard for this all season.
Jess: What if I miss? I don''t want to let the team down.
Coach Joe: Just look at the goal, pick your spot, and trust your foot.
Jess: All right. Who goes first?
Coach Joe: Jules goes first, then Mel, then you. The fans are right behind you.
Jess: Thanks, Joe. I''ll do my best.', '比赛打平进入点球;教练 Joe 让大家保持镇定;Jess 很紧张,腿还在抖;Joe 让她深呼吸,说她整个赛季都刻苦训练;Jess 怕罚丢让球队失望;Joe 让她看着球门、选好角度、相信自己的脚;主罚顺序是 Jules、Mel、然后 Jess;球迷都在身后支持她。', 'uk_female', '[{"q":"Why does the team go to penalties?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["The match ended in a draw.","The coach was angry.","It started to rain.","A player was injured."]},{"q":"How does Jess feel before the penalties?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["Calm and confident.","Very nervous, with shaking legs.","Bored and sleepy.","Angry at the coach."]},{"q":"What does Joe tell Jess to do to calm down?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["Run faster.","Shout at the crowd.","Take a few deep breaths.","Leave the field."]},{"q":"What is Jess afraid of?","type":"choice","answer":"D","options":["Winning the game.","Running too fast.","The loud crowd.","Letting the team down."]},{"q":"In what order will the players shoot?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["Jules, Mel, then Jess.","Jess first, then Jules.","Mel, Jess, then Jules.","Only Joe will shoot."]}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'long', 'required2', 'U4', 'sufe');
Behind that moment lie years of quiet, hard work.
Most top athletes train early in the morning while others are still asleep.
They repeat the same movements thousands of times until the body remembers them.
It is this hidden effort that turns an ordinary player into a champion.', '当我们看到冠军夺冠时,只看到了几分钟的高光;那一刻背后是多年默默的苦练;大多数顶尖运动员在别人还睡着的清晨就开始训练;他们把同样的动作重复成千上万次,直到身体记住;正是这种看不见的努力,让普通球员变成冠军。', 'uk_female', '[{"q":"What do people usually see when a champion wins?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["All the years of training.","Only a few bright minutes.","The athlete''s whole life.","Nothing at all."]},{"q":"What lies behind that winning moment?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["Pure luck.","A single easy day.","Years of quiet, hard work.","Other people''s help only."]},{"q":"When do most top athletes train?","type":"choice","answer":"D","options":["Late at night only.","Never in the morning.","Only on match days.","Early, while others are asleep."]},{"q":"Why do they repeat the same movements so many times?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["Until the body remembers them.","To waste time.","To make the crowd happy.","Because the coach is bored."]},{"q":"What turns an ordinary player into a champion?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["Good luck alone.","Hidden, repeated effort.","A new pair of shoes.","Watching others play."]}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'short', 'required2', 'U4', 'sufe');
Sara: I know. Wait until our team scores. The whole crowd roars together.
Liam: Why do you always wear the team''s colours to the match?
Sara: To support the players. They say our voices help them fight harder.
Liam: Look, our striker is about to shoot!
Sara: Go on, go on... Yes! It''s in the net!
Liam: Wow, everyone is screaming. I''ve never felt anything like this.
Sara: That''s why I love coming. Watching at home is just not the same.', 'Liam 第一次现场看球,觉得球场很大;Sara 说进球时全场会一起轰鸣;Liam 问她为何总穿队服来;Sara 说是为支持球员,据说球迷的呐喊能让他们更拼;前锋准备射门,球进了网;全场尖叫,Liam 从未有过这种感受;Sara 说这就是她爱来现场的原因,在家看完全不一样。', 'uk_female', '[{"q":"What is special about today for Liam?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["He is playing in the match.","He is the coach.","It is his first live football match.","He sells the tickets."]},{"q":"Why does Sara wear the team''s colours?","type":"choice","answer":"D","options":["Because it is cold.","Because she lost a bet.","To hide from the crowd.","To support the players."]},{"q":"What does Sara say the fans'' voices can do?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["Help the players fight harder.","Stop the match.","Make the players tired.","Change the rules."]},{"q":"What happens when the striker shoots?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["The ball misses.","The ball goes into the net.","The keeper catches it.","The referee stops play."]},{"q":"Why does Sara love coming to the stadium?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["The tickets are free.","There is no noise.","Watching at home is just not the same.","She dislikes football."]}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'long', 'required2', 'U4', 'sufe');
Do not be afraid to make mistakes when you are learning.
Every player, even a champion, missed many shots at the start.
If you fall, get up, take a deep breath, and try again.
Step by step, hard practice will turn today''s beginner into tomorrow''s star.', '给运动新手一个小贴士:学习时别怕犯错;每个球员,哪怕是冠军,起步时也投失过许多球;如果摔倒了,就站起来、深吸一口气、再试一次;一步一步,刻苦练习会把今天的新手变成明天的明星。', 'uk_female', '[{"q":"Who is this tip for?","type":"choice","answer":"D","options":["Only coaches.","Only champions.","Only referees.","Anyone new to a sport."]},{"q":"What does the speaker say about mistakes?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["Do not be afraid of them when learning.","Avoid the sport completely.","Mistakes are useless.","Never play again."]},{"q":"What did even champions do at the start?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["Win every game.","Miss many shots.","Never touch a ball.","Quit at once."]},{"q":"What should you do if you fall?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["Stop playing forever.","Blame your team.","Get up, breathe, and try again.","Sit and wait."]},{"q":"What will hard practice do, step by step?","type":"choice","answer":"D","options":["Make sport boring.","Waste your time.","Make you give up.","Turn a beginner into a star."]}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'short', 'required2', 'U4', 'sufe');

